    "“发送凭据”“等待板子入网”和“建立 App 控制连接”是三个独立阶段。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sending credentials, waiting for the board to join, and establishing the app control connection are three separate stages."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "認証情報の送信、ボードのネットワーク接続待ち、App の制御接続の確立は、それぞれ別の段階です。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "「傳送憑證」、「等待板子加入網路」和「建立 App 控制連線」是三個獨立階段。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
